<h1>musAIc League Privacy Policy</h1>
<p>This app stores Slack user IDs, display names, submitted song links, and vote allocations, used only to run the game inside a private Slack workspace.</p>
<p>Its YouTube integration creates unlisted playlists under the developer's own YouTube account to collect each round's submissions. No other Google user data is accessed, and nothing is shared with third parties or sold.</p>
<p>Contact: rjsikdar@gmail.com</p>
